# Catalog Sync (WooCommerce → Strapi)

## Source of truth

- **WooCommerce**: read-only (GET). Never POST/PUT/DELETE to WC.
- **Strapi**: writable target. WC wins on conflicts.

| Scenario | Action |
|----------|--------|
| In WC, missing in Strapi | Create in Strapi |
| In both, data differs | Update Strapi |
| In both, identical | Skip (unchanged) |
| In Strapi, missing in WC | Report as `strapiOnly` only |
| Delete | Never by default; optional `--deactivate-strapi-only` |

## Commands

From `apps/backend`:

```bash
npm run import:sync:dry-run -- --env production
npm run import:sync -- --env production
npm run import:sync:verify -- --env production
```

Direct:

```bash
node scripts/woocommerce-importer/catalog-sync.js dry-run --env production
node scripts/woocommerce-importer/catalog-sync.js sync --env production
node scripts/woocommerce-importer/catalog-sync.js verify --env production --allow-strapi-only
```

## Required env

- `WOOCOMMERCE_CONSUMER_KEY`
- `WOOCOMMERCE_CONSUMER_SECRET`
- `STRAPI_API_TOKEN_PRODUCTION` (production)

Optional: `IMPORT_TRACKING_DIR`, `IMPORT_IMAGES_ENABLE_UPLOAD`, `IMPORT_VIDEOS_ENABLE_UPLOAD`, `CURRENCY_MULTIPLIER`

## Sync pipeline

1. Preflight API health
2. Optional `--repair-duplicates` (dedup script)
3. Repair mappings from Strapi `external_id`
4. Categories → Products → Variations (update-all) → Media
5. Detect/report Strapi-only items
6. Save report to `import-tracking/{env}/sync-reports/`

## Flags

| Flag | Effect |
|------|--------|
| `--skip-categories` | Skip category phase |
| `--skip-media` | Skip image/video upload |
| `--repair-duplicates` | Run full dedup before sync |
| `--deactivate-strapi-only` | Set `Status: InActive` on Strapi-only products |
| `--allow-strapi-only` (verify) | Exit 0 even if Strapi-only items exist |
| `--strict-media` (verify) | Fail when WC vs Strapi media counts differ |

## Importer fixes used by sync

- **ProductImporter**: `resolveExistingStrapiProduct()` — lookup by `external_id` then slug before create
- **CategoryImporter**: update when changed; repair mapping from Strapi
- **DuplicateTracker**: debounced flush + per-type write queue (Windows-safe)
- **ProductImporter**: `syncMode: true` → sequential imports (batch size 1)

## Operational notes

- Close mapping JSON files in the editor before running
- Run only one sync instance at a time
- Always run `verify` after `sync`
- Reports: `apps/backend/import-tracking/production/sync-reports/`

## Matching keys

- Categories: `external_id`, fallback `Slug`
- Products: `external_id`, fallback `Slug`
- Variations: `external_id`, fallback `SKU`
- Stock: `external_id` = `stock_{wcVariationId}`
